[{"title":"为秋野题画","author":"王世贞","text":"飘尽江头芦荻花，疏疏黄叶见人家。\n由他庾信能萧瑟，社酒鸡豚乐未涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12400,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泸州苏丈由夕拜谪丞吴江来署昆篆方著政声与余一见杯酒平生即席有黄陂新命因成六绝句奉壮行色情见乎辞 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"才闻吴曲奏云和，忽倚征帆唱楚歌。\n两地春风试商略，吴江争似楚江多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12401,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泸州苏丈由夕拜谪丞吴江来署昆篆方著政声与余一见杯酒平生即席有黄陂新命因成六绝句奉壮行色情见乎辞 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"仙籍虽通未便收，苏家旧例是黄州。\n金莲一夜春风引，还向钧天梦里游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12402,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泸州苏丈由夕拜谪丞吴江来署昆篆方著政声与余一见杯酒平生即席有黄陂新命因成六绝句奉壮行色情见乎辞 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"百遍行杯到手空，酒阑风雅自争雄。\n前身敢道王摩诘，天下文章小许公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12403,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泸州苏丈由夕拜谪丞吴江来署昆篆方著政声与余一见杯酒平生即席有黄陂新命因成六绝句奉壮行色情见乎辞 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"欲将何物赠神君，缥渺峰头一片云。\n行过齐安倘为雨，却来秋雁好相闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12404,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泸州苏丈由夕拜谪丞吴江来署昆篆方著政声与余一见杯酒平生即席有黄陂新命因成六绝句奉壮行色情见乎辞 其五","author":"王世贞","text":"萧郎到处共仙班，娄水风烟一楫间。\n最是方城分掌握，行春同上凤皇山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12405,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泸州苏丈由夕拜谪丞吴江来署昆篆方著政声与余一见杯酒平生即席有黄陂新命因成六绝句奉壮行色情见乎辞 其六","author":"王世贞","text":"与君相见即相怜，曾傍扬雄守太玄。\n千叠白云千丈雪，不知何处是西川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12406,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"史恭甫玉虚仙院","author":"王世贞","text":"雕甍直上紫云端，玉砌依稀太乙坛。\n元是柏梁供奉客，山中亦自领祠官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12407,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李程二生皆国手也同入张公洞视仙人局戏赠一绝","author":"王世贞","text":"还携国手出人间，洞里云封玉局閒。\n却道仙家无岁月，误他樵斧烂春山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12408,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出玉女潭逢一鹤甚秀而健啄李生与之斗不胜戏作","author":"王世贞","text":"缑山明月听参差，一曲才终到凤池。\n自是王家真騕䮍，怪来凡骨不教骑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12409,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"善权寺遇秀才","author":"王世贞","text":"葫芦酒暖急须倾，踏遍青山不问名。\n君自误听才子传，当时别有一王生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12410,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出张公洞示沈道振","author":"王世贞","text":"张公岭头无片云，千奇万怪此间分。\n丹青傥可形容处，丘壑胸中也仗君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12411,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"毗陵月夜张子歌","author":"王世贞","text":"城头月出水曾光，城外酒垆黄柏香。\n贪听?郎歌宛转，任教风露湿衣裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12412,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门别李时养二绝 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"君为北客向南征，我是南人暂北行。\n阳鸟欲辞春燕至，那能不起故园情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12413,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门别李时养二绝 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"怪汝深杯百不辞，夜央相对各凄其。\n朱门酒肉应无限，谁解将情向别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12414,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸟声 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"槐柳阴阴护帝城，春衫载酒爱流莺。\n自是愁人听作泪，不关能唱两般声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12415,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸟声 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"林间姑恶无他语，只解将悲恼客眠。\n他生未断无明尽，子午山头作杜鹃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12416,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸟声 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"南风作雨北风晴，布谷朝来也勤耕。\n五湖三亩逃名地，不向人间掷此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12417,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸟声 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"朝来欲踏蹇驴出，处处精蓝觅酒僧。\n空林一声行不得，归向空斋诵小乘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12418,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅寄延绥王中丞慎徵 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"中丞绣斧下青霄，十万军声静不嚣。\n何限五原春草色，莫容代马向秦骄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12419,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅寄延绥王中丞慎徵 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"北风吹堕五云翰，念我馀生傍钓竿。\n三尺要离无左臂，祇留肝胆待君看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12420,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅寄延绥王中丞慎徵 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"十载南冠草莽臣，至今犹愧脱骖人。\n那堪一掬酬恩泪，半入渔阳半入秦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12421,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端午日小酌","author":"王世贞","text":"榴花乳燕各争新，角黍蒲觞次第陈。\n荐罢三闾还自笑，此生难作独醒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12422,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送济南张生授侯门教读还里 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"送君杨柳蓟门青，雨色能令紫马停。\n莫讶蒯缑歌不起，橐中今是五侯鲭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12423,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送济南张生授侯门教读还里 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"侯门正好曳长裾，暂拥双旌过里闾。\n若到济南人自识，少年曾受伏生书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12424,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻命有感 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"还留上宰翊皇朝，天阔春风处处饶。\n自是清时宽去就，百年兄弟好渔樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12425,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻命有感 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"空劳名姓玷公车，万死孤臣涕泪馀。\n但道不堪应过七，可能先草绝交书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12426,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻命有感 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"敢从明世拟由巢，穷骨由来怯汉貂。\n一寸酬恩心未死，岂堪回施伯通桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12427,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻命有感 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"一时真宰让山公，感旧能怜嵇侍中。\n应是不经攀柏处，断肠秋色满霜风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12428,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻命有感 其五","author":"王世贞","text":"玉颜零落数经秋，听说承恩已自愁。\n宫监满前言不得，只将双泪滴心头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12429,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻命有感 其六","author":"王世贞","text":"北阙除书日日新，肯留心事傍风尘。\n城头一片西山色，看尽人间得意人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12430,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠蔡二户部广平人 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"九天春色散铜龙，黄纸年年免上供。\n刍粟如山挥不尽，君家兄弟领司农。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12431,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠蔡二户部广平人 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"参差鹓序进贤冠，不独兄难弟亦难。\n解道滹沱饶紫气，至今双璧在邯郸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12432,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李主簿携具为别索诗 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"五陵车马日翩翩，上客空劳玳瑁筵。\n欲觅阮家青眼去，只烦流水两三弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12433,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李主簿携具为别索诗 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"与君今日混风尘，明发生涯各自新。\n何限吴山何限色，不将名姓借时人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12434,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别江上人 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"还将抖擞向风尘，一放声闻酒入唇。\n莫笑野夫无所住，出山今是住山人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12435,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别江上人 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"门前紫马踏青苔，怨别新诗可更裁。\n回首燕山当落日，城头一片碧云来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12436,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行抵平原而酒忽浊作此自嘲","author":"王世贞","text":"使君虚忝旧青州，无那平原有督邮。\n解使玺书今夜至，不教封作醉乡侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12437,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅店夜酌","author":"王世贞","text":"蹇驴秋色易黄昏，穄米茅柴老瓦盆。\n笑杀憨人周柱史，偏将紫气恼关门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12438,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过江一绝","author":"王世贞","text":"江豚吹浪浪花飞，无数征帆下钓矶。\n饶他北固山头色，不傲江南旧布衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12439,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别王生 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"肘后刀圭倘见分，不须杯酒叹离群。\n他时天眼如相觅，林屈峰头生紫云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12440,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别王生 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"玉壶天酒号长春，五岳金符字字真。\n若到缑山逢子晋，为言俱是姓王人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12441,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚人刘司封父母 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"即看贤子领公车，中垒传经定不如。\n莫怪红颜长自若，淮南旧有枕中书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12442,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚人刘司封父母 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"司封封事九天开，云锦天书五色裁。\n自是仙郎亲捧致，不烦丹凤为衔来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12443,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚人刘司封父母 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"几度玄都鬓未华，武陵春事近堪誇。\n移将度索山头种，来作桃源万树花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12444,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚人刘司封父母 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"白鹿衔芝度彩云，巫山为鬓水为裙。\n何人得似刘纲妇，名姓双教玉帝闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12445,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽金坛曹生生今太史公爱子也美秀而文弱冠摧折余虽素昧颜色颇辱神契陆汝陈来徵薤露之章因成五绝俾歌而焚之墓 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"只解新词入锦囊，不知天上爱文章。\n玉楼应是春光好，肯恋君家白玉堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12446,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽金坛曹生生今太史公爱子也美秀而文弱冠摧折余虽素昧颜色颇辱神契陆汝陈来徵薤露之章因成五绝俾歌而焚之墓 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"高楼空自遏云新，船到南徐便怆神。\n今日郗公门下客，始知强半为嘉宾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12447,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽金坛曹生生今太史公爱子也美秀而文弱冠摧折余虽素昧颜色颇辱神契陆汝陈来徵薤露之章因成五绝俾歌而焚之墓 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"空将汗血表祯符，不见骅骝一过都。\n剩有遗编数行在，九泉应自胜曹蜍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12448,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽金坛曹生生今太史公爱子也美秀而文弱冠摧折余虽素昧颜色颇辱神契陆汝陈来徵薤露之章因成五绝俾歌而焚之墓 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"劳君载酒蒜山傍，未许春风十日狂。\n一曲延陵歌作剑，白杨堆里泣秋霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12449,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽金坛曹生生今太史公爱子也美秀而文弱冠摧折余虽素昧颜色颇辱神契陆汝陈来徵薤露之章因成五绝俾歌而焚之墓 其五","author":"王世贞","text":"闺中双箸夜流红，架上千牙昼已空。\n听罢丹阳垂老句，可能还作顾非熊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12450,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戚将军赠宝剑歌 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"暂脱将军铁裲裆，辘轳垂首匣无光。\n十年侠血沾犹暖，不试燕然顶上霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12451,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戚将军赠宝剑歌 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"铸成胡冶笑相看，朵朵莲花映日寒。\n自是君家第三剑，当年不遣赠来丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12452,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戚将军赠宝剑歌 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"永夜清铅泪自流，不从飞将取封侯。\n由来龙蹻山人晓，踏上瑶京十二楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12453,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戚将军赠宝剑歌 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"毋嫌声价抵千金，一寸纯钩一寸心。\n欲识命轻恩重处，灞陵风雨夜来深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12454,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戚将军赠宝剑歌 其六","author":"王世贞","text":"霜华出匣影迷离，懒傍商山刈紫芝。\n腰下长镰来便妒，不须风雨论雄雌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12455,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戚将军赠宝剑歌 其七","author":"王世贞","text":"都督吴钩月并悬，中丞长铗字龙泉。\n相逢莫道延津事，且诵庄生第几篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12456,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戚将军赠宝剑歌 其八","author":"王世贞","text":"虎丘山头夜泊舟，青锋相为割离愁。\n吴王墓里三千剑，白虎于今不敢游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12457,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戚将军赠宝剑歌 其九","author":"王世贞","text":"螭头衔玉虎丝绦，白昼凌霜夜吼涛。\n东海王生身渐老，可能酬得吕虔刀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12458,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戚将军赠宝剑歌 其十","author":"王世贞","text":"季狂耽酒胜冯驩，醉里侯门策懒干。\n应为闽中鱼价贱，未曾留借蒯缑弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12459,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汪中丞戚都督道服访余小祇园即事 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"不知何物两道士，来摘香台石上霞。\n瞥见毫端出狮子，还惊匣里吐莲花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12460,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汪中丞戚都督道服访余小祇园即事 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"君将双衲籋芙蓉，予指孤云伴碧松。\n解道栖楣俱怖鸽，那知托钵有乖龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12461,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汪中丞戚都督道服访余小祇园即事 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"藏经阁前风雨横，猎猎梅花飞早春。\n却似脩罗初破日，满天惊散玉龙鳞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12462,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汪中丞戚都督道服访余小祇园即事 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"罢拥千帆截海涛，溪头耐可弄鱼舠。\n那轻芥子无多地，不论须弥万仞高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12463,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"调瞻美","author":"王世贞","text":"自缘耽酒厌时名，数亩溪田手自耕。\n俱道鹿门多气象，近来添得醉先生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12464,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李于鳞损饷诸物侑以新诗走笔为谢 其一 石耳","author":"王世贞","text":"西山石耳堪砺齿，挟露过云味更新。\n莫怪殷勤相寄赠，只今谁是采芝人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12465,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李于鳞损饷诸物侑以新诗走笔为谢 其二 龙井茶","author":"王世贞","text":"龙井侬分玉乳花，虎丘余剪碧璚芽。\n何时踞坐松阴下，纱帽藤衫对品茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12466,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李于鳞损饷诸物侑以新诗走笔为谢 其三 藤障子","author":"王世贞","text":"七尺苍藤织寒玉，上有筼筜映眉绿。\n昨夜方床小簟眠，却疑身在潇湘曲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12467,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李于鳞损饷诸物侑以新诗走笔为谢 其四 鹦鹉杯","author":"王世贞","text":"鹦鹉洲前祢客过，英魂磊砢堕江波。\n千秋一入高阳手，为问鸱夷量较多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12468,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题李山风雪松杉图卷二首 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"扑地漫天卒未休，松杉千尺迥堪愁。\n丹青不作王孙草，老向冰天共白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12469,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题李山风雪松杉图卷二首 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"朝色葱胧映碧虚，千峰瑶草渐凋疏。\n何当长白山头树，到了枝枝玉不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12470,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊高邮怀子相","author":"王世贞","text":"广陵东去是邗沟，斜日蒹葭黯未收。\n采就椒浆无处滴，不须闻笛也堪愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12471,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"薛子熙会予淮口有赠 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"清江欲尽见清淮，听说南人便道佳。\n何处峭风吹会面，顿教明月挂离怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12472,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"薛子熙会予淮口有赠 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"自是君才拟戴逵，手搜鸡子刻新碑。\n江南螭首应无限，若个堪题幼妇辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12473,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]